Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Marblehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a bright little beach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.41,0:00:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For Tuesday September 15th,\NPreston Beach
