Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,tide pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Expect sunny skies, around 58\Ndegrees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,with wind at 7 mph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Low tide is 8:34 AM at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,0.7 ft, then high tide comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,in at 2:50 PM.
